#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:154
msgid "Buyers pay on Stripe Checkout with a card, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Link and any other method turned on in the Stripe dashboard (Settings > Payment methods)."
msgstr "A vevők a Stripe Checkouton fizetnek kártyával, Google Pay-jel, Apple Pay-jel, Linkkel és bármely más, a Stripe irányítópulton bekapcsolt módon (Settings > Payment methods)."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:161
msgid "From the Stripe dashboard: Developers > API keys. sk_test_… for testing, sk_live_… for real payments."
msgstr "A Stripe irányítópultjáról: Developers > API keys. sk_test_… teszteléshez, sk_live_… valódi fizetésekhez."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:164
msgid "Under Developers > Webhooks, add an endpoint for checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, checkout.session.async_payment_failed, checkout.session.expired and charge.refunded."
msgstr "A Developers > Webhooks alatt adj hozzá egy endpointot a checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, checkout.session.async_payment_failed, checkout.session.expired és charge.refunded eseményekhez."

#: r2/templates/adminpaymentsettings.html:171
msgid "Buyers pay in USDC (a dollar stablecoin) from Coinbase or any crypto wallet, through Coinbase Business checkouts. Coinbase Commerce, the old service, has shut down."
msgstr "A vevők USDC-ben (dollár stablecoin) fizetnek a Coinbase-ről vagy bármilyen kriptotárcából, Coinbase Business checkoutokon keresztül. A régi szolgáltatás, a Coinbase Commerce, megszűnt."

